      <title>我国启动国际地月立方星座计划 30颗12U立方星2030年填补观测空白</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%9C%B0%E6%9C%88%E7%AB%8B%E6%96%B9%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%AE%A1%E5%88%92-30%E9%A2%9712U%E7%AB%8B%E6%96%B9%E6%98%9F2030%E5%B9%B4%E5%A1%AB%E8%A1%A5%E8%A7%82%E6%B5%8B%E7%A9%BA%E7%99%BD/</link>
